{
 "id": "cindermoor/maeve_swale",
 "start": "greet",
 "nodes": {
  "greet": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "{first} looks you up and down and says nothing at all.",
     "if": {
      "tier": "enemy"
     },
     "p": 5
    },
    {
     "text": "\"You again. Say what you want and be quick about it.\"",
     "if": {
      "tier": "rival"
     },
     "p": 5
    },
    {
     "text": "\"If it is not on the shelf, I can find it. If it cannot be found, I can find you something similar.\"",
     "if": {
      "tier_not": [
       "enemy",
       "rival"
      ]
     },
     "p": 2
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Lamp up and mind the timber. We say it twice and mean it.\"",
     "if": {
      "tier_not": [
       "enemy",
       "rival"
      ]
     },
     "p": 2
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Rain. The pit floods and the pumps groan. Everybody bails.\"",
     "if": {
      "weather": "rain",
      "tier_not": [
       "enemy",
       "rival"
      ]
     },
     "p": 3
    },
    {
     "text": "\"{greeting}\" {first} nods.",
     "if": {
      "tier": "stranger"
     },
     "p": 1
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Punctual as ever, friend. I admire that. I also resent it.\"",
     "if": {
      "tier": [
       "friend",
       "close_friend"
      ]
     },
     "p": 4
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Well met, {player}.\"",
     "if": {
      "tier": [
       "friend",
       "close_friend"
      ]
     },
     "p": 3
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "\"Heard any news?\"",
     "goto": "rumour",
     "if": {
      "tier_not": [
       "enemy",
       "rival"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "\"What do you make of Greta?\"",
     "goto": "op_greta_crowther",
     "if": {
      "tier_not": [
       "enemy",
       "rival"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "\"What do you make of Wystan?\"",
     "goto": "op_wystan_seam",
     "if": {
      "tier_not": [
       "enemy",
       "rival"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Offer a gift…",
     "goto": "",
     "if": {
      "has": "has_gift_items"
     },
     "do": [
      [
       "gift"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Good day to you.\"",
     "goto": "@end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "rumour": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "\"Candles, picks, tallow. Everything is bought by the dozen and burned by dusk.\"",
     "p": 2
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Folk buy more than they need, then bring half back. Fear shops strangely.\"",
     "p": 2
    },
    {
     "text": "\"A lamp flame leaned sideways in a sealed gallery. There is a draught from somewhere with no door.\"",
     "p": 2
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Whatever you hear about Cindermoor, half of it is true. We argue about which half.\"",
     "p": 2
    },
    {
     "text": "\"{rumour}\"",
     "if": {
      "has": "rumour"
     },
     "p": 1
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Nothing I would repeat.\"",
     "p": 0
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "\"Anything else?\"",
     "goto": "rumour"
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Thanks for telling me.\"",
     "goto": "greet",
     "do": [
      [
       "opinion",
       "chat",
       "Pleasant talk",
       2,
       5
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  "op_greta_crowther": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "\"Greta keeps a tidy yard and an untidy mouth.\""
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "\"Go on.\"",
     "goto": "rumour"
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Thanks.\"",
     "goto": "greet"
    }
   ]
  },
  "op_wystan_seam": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "\"Wystan is good company and better at keeping quiet.\""
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "\"Go on.\"",
     "goto": "rumour"
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Thanks.\"",
     "goto": "greet"
    }
   ]
  }
 }
}
